  "text": "Planning Document: docs/dcps/INNERWEST/Marrickville/Marrickville DCP 2011 - 9 0 Introduction.pdf\n\nClause Part 9 - zoning (land_use_zoning): Part 9 of this DCP divides the land where this DCP applies  into 47 planning precincts.\n\nClause 9.0 - other (development_control): Each planning precinct has its own distinct character and provides an important \ncontextual basis f or establishing appropriate types of dev elopment in association with \nother controls within the DCP.\n\nClause 9.0 - other (development_control): Each precinct has an existing and desired future \ncharacter to guide development within the area.\n\nClause 9.0 - other (development_control): Planning controls and objectives have been applied to preci nct-specific areas and site -specific are as (through masterplans) to \nassist in achieving the desired future character.\n\nClause 9.0 - heritage (development_control): Heritage conservation areas if located \nwithin a precinct are referenced.\n\n",
